flickos-cursor
==============

Upstream: https://github.com/ful1e5/Bibata_Cursor (GPL-3), through Debian's
bibata-cursor-theme 2.0.6-1, theme Bibata-Modern-Classic.

usr/share/icons/FlickOS-Bibata/ is generated and committed:

    tools/make-cursor.py [SOURCE]

Changes to upstream: only the sizes 24, 32, 48 and 64 are kept, out of 14, and
the theme has its own name and an index.theme that inherits Adwaita. Pictures,
hot spots and frame delays are as they are in Debian's files.
